{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00686","headline":"郊庙歌辞 太清宫乐章 序入破第二奏 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 太清宫乐章 序入破第二奏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虚极仙宗本，希夷象帝先。\n百灵朝太上，万法祖重圆。\n善贷惟冲德，功成谓自然。\n云门达和气，思用合钧天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00686.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00686","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}